2270-+
2271:+`prove.sh` uses strict shell settings. It regenerates `solution.mpy`, compiles the semantics, runs both prompt examples through `krun`, then invokes `kprove` once per positive claim so every required proof command has an independently visible exit status and `#Top` result. Build products go in `.kbuild/` inside the current directory.
