recursive tail equality stated as the induction hypothesis.\\n+3. A claim for the empty-list prompt example.\\n+4. A claim for the four-element prompt example, including order preservation.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019f8902-89b3-7df0-89ef-862c23491164"}}}
